WEBVTT

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:03.940
Well done, Takagi.

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:06.140
Kitami-san.

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:10.400
Now... this Z will be revived.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:32.230
<i>It was in a few accidents, since then it's been called the devil.</i>

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:36.710
<i>All it wanted to do was go faster.</i>

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:40.720
<i>It was looking for the right partner.</i>

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:47.590
<i>And Akio... you're the partner of the Devil Z.</i>

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:55.490
<i>Not just anyone will quit easily.</i>

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:58.080
<i>After looking at that...</i>

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.110
<i>The legend of Wangan will begin again.</i>

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:08.560
<i>Midnight Blue... Devil Z.</i>

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:16.100
<i>Spirit of Dogfight</i>

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.170
Fifth gear, 4000 rpm.

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:24.520
3000.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:27.840
2000.

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:29.770
Stay in fifth gear.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:32.790
Now, hit it.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:49.130
Akio, what do you think of the body and engine now?

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:51.700
It's so fast. My eyes couldn't even keep up.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.850
And it's now even at full speed yet.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:06.530
It's like a lie to be able to drive it like this again.

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:07.790
It's no lie.

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:11.610
This is indeed the resurrection of the Z.

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:17.200
How can I ever repay you, Kitami-san, and Takagi-san for this?

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.320
What? Money?

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:18.820
Yes.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.330
I don't want money.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.390
Takagi thinks the same.

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:23.600
Then... what?

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:25.910
Just keep on driving.

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:32.390
Drive this car, until the very end.

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:34.840
That's what we want you to do.

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:43.350
Now you can run it anytime.

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:44.840
The settings are all done.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.850
The engine's burnt out?

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:51.830
Yeah, I over did it.

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:55.050
I... pushed it too hard on Wangan.

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:57.420
Just like you said it would, Hiramoto-san.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:00.160
Really? That's bad news.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:01.070
I guess...

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:03.270
Speaking of which, did you know...

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:05.450
the Devil Z is back?

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:09.410
It's been tuning and testing on Wangan, every day.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.210
I heard it's even faster than before.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:17.450
Hey Hiramoto-san, are you gonna try and race with it?

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:19.640
If so, can I come along with you?

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:22.800
I can't just sit this one out!

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:27.980
<i>Boss, about the charges for that blue BMW...</i>

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:31.230
Let's charge him half a million more!

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:32.370
Anyway...

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:35.980
<i>Hey... Boss?</i>

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.450
Takagi-san.

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:51.630
How's tuning going?

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:53.720
It was finished yesterday.

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.460
Really?

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.220
I came by to tell you about it.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:04.640
Takagi-san, didn't I tell you not to leave the ward?

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:07.260
Ok, ok, I'm coming back.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.720
So stubborn...

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:14.820
Akio... is the body I made good enough for the job?

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:15.320
Yes.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:20.270
Listen, Akio, do you still remember

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.640
how to drive on Wangan?

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:25.120
Test the body, see if it can take 330km/h.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:27.530
Akio, are you...

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:28.740
Takagi-san!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.330
Are you satisfied with my work?

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:31.830
Yes!

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:36.650
Hiramoto-san.

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:41.090
Let's go to Wangan. I wanna come with you.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:43.050
You promised.

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.810
What is it, missy?

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:57.560
Come one, stop acting all innocent.
Who else is gonna take you?

00:06:58.010 --> 00:06:59.630
How did you know?

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:02.780
Just a hunch... you finished setting it up last week.

00:07:19.340 --> 00:07:22.810
Let's go, Z... to Wangan.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:39.870
Yamamoto has made some more modifications, huh?

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.120
Can you feel it?

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.550
Wow, you really are a pro.

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:46.980
That's just his style.

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:50.160
Yamamoto-san said it'll do 280km/h at most.

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:52.190
Not sure it'd go any higher.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:53.200
It's impossible.

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:57.160
That sounds just like him.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:00.460
Changing a 600hp engine to 500.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:04.810
If you could do 300, he'd stop you at 280.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:08.580
He knows the strength but never pushes it.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:09.470
So...

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:10.710
So...?

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.890
None of his customers died.

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:17.430
Not just anyone can do that, it's amazing.

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:21.440
Most drivers are not smart enough to work that out.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:24.920
If they're only meant to go to 300km/h...

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:27.450
they'd always go higher than 300.

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:33.050
They'd take it to 301.

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:35.050
And then 302...

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.950
No matter how fast, they'd never stop.

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:39.950
Only someone experienced would get it.

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:45.850
There's no such thing as stopping at the highest speed.

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:49.220
<i>Is it just me or...?</i>

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.720
<i>I something coming up very fast from behind.</i>

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.910
Harada, are there any cars coming up behind us?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.860
No, can't see any.

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:08.110
<i>No, it's coming. It's faster than me.</i>

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:16.730
Harada, I'm sorry if anything happens to you tonight but...

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:18.780
I can't take any responsibility. I'm flat broke.

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:20.300
That's ok.

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:24.050
<i>It's here.</i>

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:36.470
<i>I've dreamed of this many times.</i>

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:42.350
<i>Unbelievable...</i>

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:46.340
<i>I thought I'd lose it when this moment came.</i>

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:49.160
<i>But I feel so calm at the moment.</i>

00:09:57.630 --> 00:10:01.860
<i>Look at my real dragon!</i>

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:04.380
<i>This R cost me everything I had.</i>

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:09.830
<i>Check out the most powerful R!</i>

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:21.300
<i>Koichi, you chose a car over the happiness of our child.</i>

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.300
<i>I gave up my true happiness...</i>

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:26.110
<i>and chose a damn race car.</i>

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:38.070
<i>Ok, let's see who'll win.</i>

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:43.730
<i>I must know who's fastest.
That's... that's what I want to know!</i>

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:57.290
<i>Oil temperature, 110.</i>

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.710
<i>Water's at 90.</i>

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:06.860
<i>The engine can take all of these revs no problem, in theory.</i>

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:10.430
<i>I'm waiting...</i>

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.920
<i>Holding 7000rpm at 250km/h.</i>

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:16.010
<i>While there are no other cars.</i>

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:18.500
<i>At the "all clear" moment, accelerate to 200.</i>
<i>All clear - when there's no other cars on the road.</i>

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:21.460
<i>He's gonna try for 320km/h any second.</i>

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:31.910
<i>Now, there's no other cars.</i>

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:35.630
<i>It's nearly “all clear”.</i>

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:41.390
<i>So close...</i>

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:46.100
<i>So close...</i>

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:52.370
<i>All clear!</i>

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:58.360
<i>Z?</i>

00:11:59.080 --> 00:11:59.880
<i>Is it slowing?</i>

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:05.370
<i>Akio, get to the Yokohama line at Wangan.</i>

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:10.380
<i>Dodge the traffic at 250km/h before the tunnel.</i>

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:14.380
<i>At 100km/h, you'll pass all the other cars.</i>

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:21.840
<i>Use all three lanes at the big bend.</i>

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:24.060
<i>Then to 280km/h out of the tunnel.</i>

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:28.920
<i>T-This acceleration!</i>

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:30.820
<i>It just keeps on going.</i>

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:32.560
<i>Time to go, right now.</i>

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:35.070
<i>The Z can't catch us now.</i>

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:38.030
<i>No way!</i>

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:44.250
<i>The Z has just taken us!</i>

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.500
<i>At Haneda tunnel get to 300.</i>

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:54.200
<i>The Z will be just like an arrow from a bow.</i>

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:57.510
<i>It'll generate downforce making it more stable at speed.</i>

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:02.090
<i>Don't just step on the gas yet...</i>

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.930
<i>even though the body will take it.</i>

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:08.180
<i>He's still accelerating even now!</i>

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:17.190
<i>By the time you reach the bridge, you'll be at 330km/h.</i>

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:21.360
<i>What?</i>

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:32.580
There is such a car... and it's here now.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:39.100
<i>Only here, this place... has everything I want!</i>

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.760
BlackBird's turning at the Ooi junction to get back on the loop.

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:51.060
Just follow him. I'm sure we'll see something...

00:13:57.290 --> 00:14:00.070
I was 19 when I first saw that Z.

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.220
At the 3rd Keihindo.

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.950
The Z just gets further and
further away no matter how fast you go.

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:08.760
I became obsessed with it right away.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:14.330
The L28 engine was something unobtainable in this country.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:17.020
Only a few parts were changed

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:19.250
and it managed to run at such a speed.

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:23.450
The owner didn't want to sell it to me in the beginning.

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:25.400
Finally he agreed to but...

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:28.760
I still didn't get the Z.

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:33.420
10 years later...

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.280
I saw the Z again.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.520
It was then I managed to get it.

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:42.950
I bored the L28 to 3.1 liters and added a twin turbo.

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:46.030
I gave it the power of the devil.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:50.600
When I was 19, then 10 years later
and now this is the 3rd time.

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:55.000
The Z appears in front of me... with it's finest driver.

00:14:57.300 --> 00:15:00.250
My workshop closed down. I lost my family.

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:03.200
But I'm happy.

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:08.060
I've been obsessed with speed since I was 19.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.480
What could be better than this moment?

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:25.690
<i>Devil Z and the BlackBird...</i>

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:27.950
<i>And Kitami Jun…</i>

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.410
Let him go...

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.620
Don't take him on just because he's in a R.

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:40.110
Are you saying that R is more powerful?

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:42.670
It doesn't matter who's more powerful.

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:45.610
Tonight, we're just the audience.

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:48.170
Take a good look at the facts.

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:53.380
Although both of you drive R's,
he's totally different from you.

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:55.390
Is it because I'm a woman?

00:15:55.810 --> 00:15:57.390
Not just that.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.910
There are a lot of differences.

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:05.650
He should get it since he was totally defeated.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:09.080
Now he gets another go with a new R.

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:12.350
He had to give up everything to get here.

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:14.780
It was his own choice.

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:17.820
It doesn't matter if you don't understand why.

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:22.540
He gave up everything for this and
therefore is different from you.

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:34.230
<i>It's very narrow, it's the first time the loop's been too narrow.</i>

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:39.230
<i>It's hard to breathe... I need to get there so badly.</i>

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:41.480
<i>To get to full speed.</i>

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:54.670
<i>I have done whatever I can.</i>

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:55.910
<i>This is the most powerful R.</i>

00:16:57.100 --> 00:17:02.420
<i>But I thought you'd appreciate the exhaust I'd made you.</i>

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:05.410
<i>I know, this is the best, Matsu.</i>

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:10.930
<i>I'm a coward, so... I can't live with you anymore!</i>

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.880
<i>This is the last time!</i>

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.140
<i>I need to know who's the best!</i>

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:25.030
<i>Soon, the traffic will drop off.</i>

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:28.650
<i>The flow of cars has completely
changed in the last half hour.</i>

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.360
<i>There's no time for common sense anymore.</i>

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.060
<i>Just another half hour...</i>

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.900
<i>This is my one shot.</i>

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:43.330
<i>It's 33km from Kasai to Bay Bridge on Wangan West.</i>

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:47.340
<i>The final chance at the Wangan!</i>

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:22.370
<i>Here we go. Let's see who's gonna win it.</i>

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:25.670
<i>It's no good waiting until the risky Kanagawa area.</i>

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:29.840
<i>Wait for the "all clear" then gun it to 320km/h.</i>

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:42.810
<i>Here? In the traffic?</i>

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.260
It's impossible, Hiramoto.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:52.530
It's too risky.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.010
<i>All clear!</i>

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:20.320
<i>Around 1km to the truck in front.</i>

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:23.680
<i>Accelerate from 280 to 320km/h.</i>

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:27.770
<i>Three lanes with two trucks side by side.</i>

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:30.690
<i>Only one car will get through.</i>

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:40.360
<i>Acceleration is now the key to winning this race.</i>

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.380
<i>Only the fastest car will make it through.</i>

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:50.590
<i>Who... who's the fastest driver here?</i>

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:09.600
<i>You used to say that the top speed
is gone in a seconds hesitation...</i>

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:51.760
<i>Fifth gear, 7000rpm, 320km/h on the clock.</i>

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:54.680
<i>I'm in the perfect position.</i>

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:55.780
<i>This is it.</i>

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:00.140
<i>No...</i>

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:02.740
<i>This is meaningless...</i>

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:07.480
<i>The Devil Z has been resurrected.</i>

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.280
Engine trouble?

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:27.230
No chance, his R is in perfect shape.

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.920
I didn't floor it... I let go.

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:35.860
<i>If you had stepped on it...</i>

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:36.730
There is no "if"...

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:40.240
I just didn't bother, that's all.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:43.440
He knew there's no such thing as a winner here.

00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:46.850
It doesn't matter who or when.

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:48.530
It's the choices you make.

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:50.710
Nothing is final.

00:21:51.190 --> 00:21:53.190
He chose to let go.

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:57.300
There'll never be an eternal winner.

00:21:57.910 --> 00:21:59.910
Some will give up, some will stay...

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:00.710
and that's it.

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:10.970
<i>You made the right choice, Hiramoto.</i>

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:53.270
<i>The baby was born on 18th June.</i>

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:57.270
<i>He weighs 3,24kg.</i>
